{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15210330","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032001:":{"text":"余は……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog45>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCAB2BD21B2EA823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032002:":{"text":"本当にダメな領主だったのか……？","source_cn":"我真的做得很糟糕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F3F0506C7CD625D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032003:":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog104>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7BE6E6A945A0962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032004:":{"text":"だから、ホーリン城は厄災に見舞われたのか……？","source_cn":"呼临城的灾难是因为我吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91EA26CE34D3012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034001:":{"text":"はぁ、はぁ……そこをどいてくれ！","source_cn":"呼、呼！麻烦让一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD458CEF998BB9A87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034002:":{"text":"何があったのだ？","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278B02A51CF19C74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521033001:0":{"text":"余が無能だから……神はホーリン城に罰を下したのだろうか？","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521033001":{"text":"余が無能だから……神はホーリン城に罰を下したのだろうか？","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521033002:0":{"text":"余も早く大人になりたいと思っておる！父上のような、頼りになって尊敬される大人に……","source_cn":"我也想尽快长大，变得像父亲一样可靠，受人尊敬……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF456599BA73263C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521033004:0":{"text":"腹を空かせた民を助けたくて、色んな方法を考えた。でも、全部否定されて……","source_cn":"我想了很多方法，想要帮助吃不上饭的人，但一直都被否决……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5236BE003634D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521033005:0":{"text":"あなたが考えた方法は、効果がなかったんです。先ほどの親子がその証拠です。","source_cn":"你的方法没有那么好。刚刚那对父子的遭遇就证明了这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB49EF1BE86E515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521033006:0":{"text":"大勢に行き渡るよう、一人ひとりに配る量を減らしても、それで彼らの空腹は満たせません。","source_cn":"为了让更多人领到食物，所以每个人都少拿一点。但他们还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C551F2ACAFFC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521033007:0":{"text":"でも、本来街には大量の食料があったのだ。今の何倍も！","source_cn":"但城里的食物原本很多，是现在的好几倍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81818CE9FB09A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521033008:0":{"text":"議事官たちがヤクボルに攻撃を仕掛けると決めて、食料を前線に送っていなければ、備蓄は十分あったはずなのだ……","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521033008":{"text":"議事官たちがヤクボルに攻撃を仕掛けると決めて、食料を前線に送っていなければ、備蓄は十分あったはずなのだ……","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里的存粮不会这么少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521033009:0":{"text":"違う！ホーリンは災害で苦しんでいるのだぞ。余に決定権があれば、真っ先に民の救援を命じた！","source_cn":"当然不是！呼临城正在受灾，如果我能决定的话，肯定要先救灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E60A8ED58BABA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521033011:0":{"text":"ペルセウスは？彼はあなたを支持しているのでしょう？","source_cn":"珀尔修斯呢？你说过，他支持你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC733F568C49279E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521033012:0":{"text":"たしかに、あやつは出兵に反対していたが、ビルボ先生や他の議事官が聞き入れなくてな……","source_cn":"……他确实不同意正面出兵。但是比博老师和其他议事官坚持。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02BE501CA153863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521033013:0":{"text":"「飢饉には手の打ちようがなく、干ばつも豊穣神に祈るほかない。だが神は、いまだ我らの祈りに応じてはくださらない……ゆえに、ヤクボルへ攻め入るしかないのだ」と言って……","source_cn":"大家都说，饥荒没办法很快解决，干旱也只能向丰饶神祈求，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD19A1A0F788D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521033014:0":{"text":"何もしなければ、ホーリンの民は飢え死にしてしまう……それだけは、決してあってはならぬ！","source_cn":"否则，否则呼临人都会饿死……我不能看着呼临城发生这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC82AD2A4950EB2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521033015:1":{"text":"その後……一刻も早くヤクボルに攻め入るには、前線に食料を大量に送る必要があるとも言われて……だから、民へ配る分がますます減ってしまったのだ……","source_cn":"可是……可是之后他们又说必须尽快攻占雅库伯尔，所以把很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2D34F4776079CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521033016:0":{"text":"余も、どうすればいいのか分からなかった……もう、後戻りはできなかったのだ……","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1521033016":{"text":"余も、どうすればいいのか分からなかった……もう、後戻りはできなかったのだ……","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521033017:0":{"text":"そなたが何を言いたいのかは分かる……","source_cn":"我、我知道你的意思了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x024A06E58322099C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そなたが何を言いたいのかは分かる……","female":"そなたが何を言いたいのかは分かる……","variant_male_record_index":"183387","variant_female_record_index":"183388","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521033019:0":{"text":"すまぬ……余のせいだ。","source_cn":"对不起……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CC81DDE3A06174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521033020:0":{"text":"謝らなければならないのは、議事官たちの方だと思います。","source_cn":"和你比起来，那些议事官更应该道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C239CD0688F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521033021:0":{"text":"え……？","source_cn":"咦……？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F74F80CE685FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521033022:0":{"text":"あなたは領主です。たとえまだ子どもでも、彼らはあなたの命令に従わなくてはなりません。","source_cn":"你是领主，无论年纪多小，他们都应该听从你的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40370A4139936EDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521033023:0":{"text":"あなたが戦いたくないと言うのなら、そうするべきです。","source_cn":"你不想开战，他们就应该听从你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D317EA94E910A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521033024:0":{"text":"歯向かう者には処罰を与えればいい。牢屋に入れるか、肉体労働させるか、もしくは命を差し出させ――","source_cn":"如果反抗，就该惩罚。关起来，或者做苦力，或者让他们献出生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BD5EE860DE232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521033025:1":{"text":"い、命を……？それは……殺せと言うことか！？","source_cn":"献……献出生命？！你的意思是……杀了他们吗？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF84C815DFD6A471B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"い、命を……？それは……殺せと言うことか！？","female":"い、命を……？それは……殺せと言うことか！？","variant_male_record_index":"183396","variant_female_record_index":"183397","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521033026:0":{"text":"さすがにそこまでは……彼らは余と意見が違うだけで、罪を犯したわけではない！","source_cn":"这太严重了……他们只是和我意见不同，又没有真的犯罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC605864F01822D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1521033026":{"text":"さすがにそこまでは……彼らは余と意見が違うだけで、罪を犯したわけではない！","source_cn":"这太严重了……他们只是和我意见不同，又没有真的犯罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC605864F01822D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521033027:0":{"text":"き、きっと、余と同じように、他にいい方法が思いつかなかったのだ。","source_cn":"可能他们也没有更好的办法……和我一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8E1F0AD41B10AFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521033029:0":{"text":"ビルボ先生が言っておったのだ、慈悲深い君主は……相手の……えっと……","source_cn":"比博老师说过，一个仁爱的君主，应该……呃，应该宽恕那些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0CFF35561B7B41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521033030:0":{"text":"うーん、なんだったかな……\nとにかく、他人の無知を責めてはならぬと言っておったのだ。","source_